@startuml Product Search Sequence
!theme plain
title ZAI E-commerce Platform - Sequence de Recherche de Produits

actor Customer as "Client"
participant "ProductController" as ProdCtrl
participant "ProductModel" as ProdM
participant "CategoryModel" as CatM
participant "DolibarrAPI" as Doli
participant "SearchEngine" as Search
participant "Database" as DB

Customer -> ProdCtrl: searchProducts(query, filters)
activate ProdCtrl

note over ProdCtrl : Validation et nettoyage\nde la requête de recherche

ProdCtrl -> ProdCtrl: validateSearchQuery(query)
ProdCtrl -> ProdCtrl: sanitizeInput(query)

ProdCtrl -> Search: processSearchQuery(query)
activate Search

note over Search : Analyse de la requête\net extraction des mots-clés

Search -> Search: extractKeywords(query)
Search -> Search: buildSearchCriteria(keywords)
Search --> ProdCtrl: searchCriteria
deactivate Search

ProdCtrl -> ProdM: searchProducts(searchCriteria, filters)
activate ProdM

ProdM -> Doli: searchInProducts(searchCriteria)
activate Doli

note over Doli : Recherche dans les tables:\n- llx_product (label, description)\n- llx_product_extrafields\n- llx_categorie

Doli -> DB: SELECT p.*, pe.*, c.label as category_name\nFROM llx_product p\nJOIN llx_product_extrafields pe ON p.rowid = pe.fk_object\nLEFT JOIN llx_categorie c ON p.fk_categorie = c.rowid\nWHERE (p.label LIKE ? OR p.description LIKE ?)\nAND p.tosell = 1\nAND p.fk_product_type = 0
activate DB
DB --> Doli: resultats bruts
deactivate DB

Doli -> Doli: applyFilters(results, filters)
note right : Application des filtres:\n- Prix min/max\n- Catégorie\n- Disponibilité\n- Marque

Doli -> Doli: calculateRelevanceScore(results, keywords)
note right : Calcul de la pertinence\nbasé sur la correspondance\ndes mots-clés

Doli --> ProdM: searchResults with relevance
deactivate Doli

ProdM -> ProdM: sortByRelevance(results)
ProdM -> ProdM: highlightSearchTerms(results, keywords)

ProdM --> ProdCtrl: sortedResults
deactivate ProdM

ProdCtrl -> CatM: getSuggestedCategories(keywords)
activate CatM
CatM -> DB: SELECT DISTINCT c.* FROM llx_categorie c\nJOIN llx_product p ON c.rowid = p.fk_categorie\nWHERE c.label LIKE ?
activate DB
DB --> CatM: categories suggérées
deactivate DB
CatM --> ProdCtrl: suggestedCategories
deactivate CatM

ProdCtrl -> ProdM: getSimilarProducts(topResults)
activate ProdM
ProdM -> Doli: findSimilarProducts(productIds)
activate Doli
Doli --> ProdM: similarProducts
deactivate Doli
ProdM --> ProdCtrl: recommendations
deactivate ProdM

ProdCtrl -> Search: logSearchQuery(query, resultCount, userId)
activate Search
note right : Enregistrement des\nstatistiques de recherche
Search -> DB: INSERT INTO search_logs\n(query, result_count, user_id, timestamp)
activate DB
DB --> Search: logged
deactivate DB
Search --> ProdCtrl: statistics saved
deactivate Search

note over ProdCtrl : Préparation de la réponse\navec résultats, suggestions\net recommandations

ProdCtrl --> Customer: search results page
deactivate ProdCtrl

note over Customer : Affichage des résultats\navec termes surlignés,\nfiltres et suggestions

@enduml